      "source_tier": "official",
      "excerpt": "Perched on a secluded headland at the northern tip of Koh Samui, Six Senses Samui invites you to slow down and savor the simple pleasures of island life."
    },
    {
      "id": "r-2",
      "category": "rooms",
      "text": "The villas blend into the natural landscape with views across the Gulf of Thailand.",
      "source_url": "https://www.sixsenses.com/en/hotels-resorts/asia-the-pacific/thailand/samui/",
      "source_tier": "official",
      "excerpt": "villas blend seamlessly into the natural landscape with views across the Gulf of Thailand."
    },
    {
      "id": "r-3",
      "category": "amenities",
      "text": "At Six Senses Spa, private treatment salas overlook a rock-fringed bay.",
